      "notes": "Columnar split with a 16-key thumb cluster: 62 MX hot-swap sockets plus 8 Kailh Choc hot-swap sockets. Pin support of the MX sockets is not stated. Tenting add-on goes up to 60 degrees. Wireless (+$90), tenting (+$80) and underglow are paid add-ons; the wireless version has a 2370 mAh battery per half (4740 mAh total). Price is the regular price of the base (wired, no tenting) version; a sale was running."
