      "notes": "68 keys in ANSI (69 in ISO): 64/65 MX hot-swap sockets plus 4 low-profile Kailh Choc thumb keys; 8 thumb keys in all. Row stagger is inferred from the ANSI and ISO layouts. Pin support of the MX sockets is not stated. USB, Bluetooth (5 devices) and low-latency RF with the wireless add-on. Wireless (+$90), tenting (+$80) and underglow are paid add-ons; the wireless version has a 2370 mAh battery per half (4740 mAh total). Price is the regular price of the base (wired, no tenting) version; a sale was running."
